<statement>
<p>
Let A = <lbrace/>1, 3, 4, 7, 10<rbrace/> and B = <lbrace/>1, 6, 7<rbrace/>.  Indicate if each statement is true or false.</p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{10}\in{A}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>True</li> 
<li>False</li> 
</ol></p>
<p>
<m>\displaystyle{B}\subset{A}</m> </p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>True</li> 
<li>False</li> 
</ol></p>


</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>A: True</li><li>B: False</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

